     H****************************************************************
     A* Revisions:                                                   *
     A*                                                              *
     A****************************************************************
     A*  Medicare Query Header External Data Structure
     A                                      REF(SREFP)
     A          R PQD                       TEXT('Medicare Query Header ext DS')
     A            QDDCN1        30A
     A                                      COLHDG('Primary Identifier')
     A            QDDCN2        30A
     A                                      COLHDG('Secondary Identifier')
     A            QDLSN     R               REFFLD(DS6)
     A                                      COLHDG('Last Name')
     A            QDFSN     R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A                                      COLHDG('First Initial')
     A            QDDTOB        10A
     A                                      COLHDG('Date of Birth')
     A            QDSEX     R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A                                      COLHDG('Sex')
     A            QDSS#          9A
     A                                      COLHDG('SSN')
     A            QDHI      R               REFFLD(DS12)
     A                                      COLHDG('Header indicator')
